1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:30,300
You're probably only here to butter up our Senior Brother

3
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:33,660
and also check out that Secret Manual, right?

4
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:34,700
Enough!

5
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:37,020
Am I really that incompetent of a Coach?

6
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:39,900
Cold Cat.

7
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:40,860
Hot Dog.

8
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:41,800
Where's Leo?

9
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,780
Where's Leo?

10
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:44,700
Do it again if you've got the skill!

11
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,140
We didn't see it clearly.

12
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:50,460
This is my unparalleled Western Speed Style.

13
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Episode 34

14
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,110
Of course!

15
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,100
As the Future Distinguished

16
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,500
Critic of the Yo-Yo World,

17
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,390
I constantly follow

18
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,860
the Global Yo-Yo scene.

19
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,710
I also constantly study

20
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:10,140
the Advanced theories of every School.

21
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,540
Alright, Shawn.

22
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,940
Leo, before the Tournament,

23
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,340
do you have enough time to Master it?

24
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,670
I finished the Red and Orange

25
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,740
Holy Light moves in the US.

26
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,980
But I still couldn't beat him.

27
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,860
Recently, inspired by Shawn,

28
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:33,660
I also completed the Yellow, Green,
Cyan, and Purple moves.

29
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:36,030
Then you're almost there, right?

30
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,470
You just don't get it.

31
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,900
Among the Seven colors, "Blue" is the hardest to Master.

32
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,820
And there's not much time left.

33
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,740
If Leo could train in seclusion,

34
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,180
it would be much more effective.

35
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,580
Oh, so that's how it is.

36
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:51,420
But as the Captain of Jianghai Team,

37
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,340
I shoulder the responsibility

38
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,740
of us winning the Team Championship.

39
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,920
And now Coach Tony is injured.

40
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,540
I can't just abandon the Team.

41
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,900
It looks like before the Tournament,

42
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:05,340
mastering the Blue Holy Light move

43
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,230
is just not possible.

44
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,670
Then just go train in Seclusion.

45
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,560
Why hesitate?

46
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:12,540
I also suggest that everyone
practice their Signature Moves well,

47
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,460
and don't embarrass the Jianghai Team.

48
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,310
That way, Leo can train in seclusion with peace of mind.

49
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,900
That's not right. I've thought about it.

50
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,060
The Jianghai Team's honor should still come first.

51
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,940
But I think this Individual
Championship is also very important.

52
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,820
Because the stakes are higher than ever.

53
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,740
Actually, Leo only needs a week of seclusion training

54
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,140
to Perfect it completely

55
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,020
But we all need to agree to it.

56
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:37,980
I agree.

57
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:38,940
Agreed.

58
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,780
I'll go with the flow. I agree.

59
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:43,260
I object.

60
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,620
I strongly object.

61
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,470
Don't you think Leo is being

62
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,350
too selfish?

63
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,860
Coach Tony put him in full charge.

64
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:55,740
He entrusted the entire Jianghai Team's honor to him.

65
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:58,110
How can he just abandon all of this

66
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:01,510
to go train in seclusion on his Seven-Color Holy Light?

67
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,600
Teddy, if Leo beats Michael,

68
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,400
and wins the Individual Championship,

69
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,180
That's also for the School and the Jianghai Team.

70
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,580
I think the significance goes even deeper.

71
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,980
When I heard Michael talk about Eastern Intuition,

72
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,900
how it can never defeat Western Speed,

73
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,040
It makes me furious.

74
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:19,260
I don't like Michael either.

75
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:21,660
I want him to lose completely.

76
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:26,940
I think everyone has a valid point.

77
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,760
Mini, what do you say?

78
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,260
Well...

79
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,180
I'll restate my opinion.

80
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,060
Leo winning the Individual Title is certainly important.

81
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,420
But isn't the Jianghai Team's
Group Championship important too?

82
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,310
The key is

83
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,740
to find a plan that satisfies both goals.

84
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,920
Shawn, you've read a lot of books

85
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,540
and researched a ton of issues.

86
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,270
Why don't you come up with a plan for us?

87
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:55,230
Well... the theories in books

88
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:58,590
are all rather abstract and profound.

89
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,500
They don't address such specific, simple issues.

90
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,300
Useless...

91
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,140
Stop being so annoying! Teddy,

92
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:13,750
if you have a plan, then spit it out!

93
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,900
I actually do have a plan that's a win-win.

94
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:19,940
But Leo has to agree to it.

95
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,770
As long as it's effective,

96
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,140
I won't object.

97
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:24,060
Here's the thing.

98
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,940
Since Leo wants to focus

99
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,860
on winning the Individual Championship,

100
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,680
and train in seclusion,

101
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,490
I believe the Team wont
last long without a Leader.

102
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,470
So I suggest

103
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:40,380
Leo should give up the Captain position.

104
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:44,030
and pass the burden to someone else.

105
00:05:46,020 --> 00:05:47,100
So I propose

106
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,570
that Mark be reappointed Captain of the Jianghai Team.

107
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,300
as long as everyone agrees,

108
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:57,050
I agree that Mark should be
the Captain of the Jianghai Team.

109
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:58,620
I disagree.

110
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,940
In terms of skill and strategy,
I'm no match for Leo.

111
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:04,960
I think

112
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:08,220
it's best if Leo remains Captain.

113
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,590
But Leo is too busy right now.

114
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,740
We just can't operate without a Leader!

115
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,900
If you won't do it, then I will!

116
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,780
What? Did I hear that right?

117
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,180
Not just anyone can be Captain.

118
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,580
But someone has to do it.

119
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:27,420
Leo's too busy, Mark's too modest.

120
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,340
As for the rest of you,

121
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,740
I think my skills are the best.

122
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,660
Right, Chuck?

123
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,020
I guess so...

124
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,460
Probably.

125
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,380
More or less.

126
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,780
Maybe.

127
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,180
What do you mean, "maybe"?
It's not even close.

128
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,580
You're not Captain material at all.

129
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,460
You couldn't even be Vice-Captain.

130
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,340
I strongly object!

131
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,780
Teddy,

132
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,660
Stop obsessing over being Captain all the time!

133
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,100
What is wrong with all of you!

134
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,980
I'm just thinking about the big picture,
considering the whole Team!

135
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,140
Why are you all ganging up on me?!

136
00:07:04,050 --> 00:07:05,340
Teddy...

137
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,180
Let him go.

138
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,900
Actually, what Teddy said makes sense.

139
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:17,590
We can't afford to get careless either.

140
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,260
I have a solution.

141
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:21,660
I suddenly had a flash of inspiration.

142
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,580
Like a shooting star across the night sky.

143
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:27,420
It's like they say: "Preparation never wastes time."

144
00:07:27,900 --> 00:07:28,500
You see,

145
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:31,260
So all that daily Studying and Training wasn't for nothing.

146
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,660
At the crucial moment, Bam!

147
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,100
My brain just clicked,

148
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,020
and the solution appeared.

149
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,420
Hurry up and spit it out! Enough with the chatter.

150
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,600
Here's the thing.

151
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:44,640
Leo's going to train in seclusion for a week, right?

152
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,140
So this week,

153
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:48,060
we'll choose a Temporary Captain.

154
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,500
to take charge of Training first.

155
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,380
And once Leo steps out of seclusion,

156
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:56,220
the Temporary Captain returns
the position back to Leo.

157
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:59,580
That way, nothing gets neglected.

158
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,500
Oh, come on.

159
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,860
I thought you had some Earth-Shattering idea.

160
00:08:06,180 --> 00:08:07,260
Actually, that's not a bad plan.

161
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,660
I think it'll work.

162
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,420
Mark, you won't disagree, right?

163
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,300
I guess this is the only way.

164
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:22,620
I'll follow the Original plan
and lead everyone in Training.

165
00:08:23,260 --> 00:08:25,020
If there are problems, we'll discuss with Leo.

166
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,900
Once Leo masters his Signature Move,

167
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,780
we'll each reveal our own Signature Moves.

168
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,420
What does everyone think?

169
00:08:33,430 --> 00:08:36,710
Agreed.

170
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:38,990
Thanks for everyone's Support.

171
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:41,930
I'll definitely work hard to master Ultimate Holy Light.

172
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,930
Finally, I want to remind everyone of one thing:

173
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:47,580
Remember, don't act on emotion.

174
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:50,950
Never reveal your Signature Moves before the Tournament.

175
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:52,350
Understood.

176
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:54,780
When I faced Cold Cat earlier,
I didn't use my Signature Move.

177
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:57,180
Don't worry, Captain.

178
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,050
Even if I Master it, I won't use it.

179
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,980
You dummy, then what's the point of Training?

180
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,580
Just a tiny bit...

181
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,410
Just a little more will do it.

182
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:41,820
I think I saw a Blue Light flash for an instant.

183
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,260
What's the point?

184
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:46,620
A Random flash doesn't mean anything.

185
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,500
Then I'll try again.

186
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:20,220
Clear your mind. Don't let anything distract you.

187
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,580
At the moment of success,

188
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,530
it's easiest to lose your cool.

189
00:10:27,580 --> 00:10:28,430
It's all about your Mindset.

190
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,740
No matter what, don't let excitement get to you.

191
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:37,500
Your mind must be as calm as water. Otherwise...

192
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,390
You keep rambling on,

193
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,860
always saying things that are completely off track.

194
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,780
What exactly is Leo lacking?

195
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:43,740
Can you even tell us?

196
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:46,280
I already explained it to Leo!

197
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,490
You don't need to worry about it.

198
00:10:48,700 --> 00:10:50,710
I'm the one worrying?
You're the one throwing out nonsense!

199
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,450
Stop talking nonsense.

200
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:54,780
Hey, Shawn.

201
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,700
Then what should Leo do

202
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,620
to achieve the Blue Holy Light?

203
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:01,500
Can you be a bit more specific?

204
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:03,900
He has to figure it out himself.

205
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:06,300
As the saying goes, a Master can open the door,

206
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,410
but the Student has to go through it.

207
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,620
You get it?

208
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,500
You still dare call yourself Leo's Master?

209
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,420
Oh, come on.

210
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,670
Well, at least I'm his Theoretical Guide!

211
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:21,660
Let me put it this way.

212
00:11:22,300 --> 00:11:23,770
Since the Blue Holy Light has already appeared,

213
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,940
it means that Leo, in terms of technique,

214
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,380
can already achieve it.

215
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:33,660
Now the only thing left is the Mental Barrier.

216
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:34,960
Does that mean he'll get it soon?

217
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,770
The hardest hurdle is the Mental one.

218
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:43,260
Some people can never overcome it in their entire lives.

219
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,660
Don't jinx it.

220
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,740
I kept saying to myself in my heart

221
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:59,100
Blue... Blue... Blue...

222
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:01,950
Sure enough, the Cyan Light slowly...

223
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:03,900
began to fade away.

224
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,300
And a faint Blue Light appeared.

225
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,180
I held my breath.

226
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:12,060
Blue! Blue! It's blue!

227
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,460
It appeared! It finally appeared!

228
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,820
And then what happened?

229
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,220
I clearly saw the Blue Light,

230
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:22,620
but it suddenly vanished.

231
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,060
And reverted right back to Cyan.

232
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,420
One time the color even deepened

233
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:28,710
and turned completely Purple.

234
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,740
Do you know what caused it to change colours?

235
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,150
Shawn said

236
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:35,320
it's caused by Leo's Mental Strength.

237
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:36,990
No way!

238
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:37,980
If you've identified the right cause,

239
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:40,350
then Leo should be able to fix it quickly.

240
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,820
How come he still hasn't mastered it by now?

241
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,260
That's what I said too.

242
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,670
But Shawn said

243
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:46,620
the Mental Barrier is the hardest to surpass.

244
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:49,020
Some people can't overcome it in their lifetime.

245
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,940
Shawn is talking nonsense.

246
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,860
He once said that in my whole life

247
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,740
I'd never escape the temptation of food.

248
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,620
Actually, ever since I decided to lose weight,

249
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,540
I've stopped overeating.

250
00:13:03,580 --> 00:13:06,300
Shawn's words aren't very reliable.

251
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:08,220
Sometimes I find him baffling.

252
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:10,140
Once he was far too ridiculous.

253
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,580
He said to me with a serious expression,

254
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,980
"Monica,"

255
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,900
"you have a fatal weakness."

256
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,820
"You care too much about your appearance"

257
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,700
"and neglect focusing on your inner"

258
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:23,100
"self."

259
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,420
Is there something wrong with his brain?

260
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:29,340
I know, right?

261
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:31,260
First he says I care too much about myself,

262
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,180
and then he says I neglect myself too much.

263
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,580
How can you be so contradictory?

264
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:36,510
He just shook his head at me.

265
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:37,470
He just shook his head at me.

266
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,940
as if I were the hopeless one,

267
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:39,990
and not him.

268
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,340
He said,

269
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,850
"Your appearance is just a shell."

270
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:46,620
"Your true self is within your heart."

271
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,540
"That is the soul."

272
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,460
"You should seize it and focus on it."

273
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:52,380
Then he walked away all cocky.

274
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,260
He's so ridiculous.

275
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:59,100
If he said that to me, I wouldn't be scared.

276
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,510
Having a ghost

277
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,740
living inside of your body...

278
00:14:01,750 --> 00:14:02,830
Even if there is one,

279
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,600
it'd just be another Chuck!

280
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,610
Shawn meant it's a person's inner self,

281
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:09,180
Not a ghost.

282
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,630
I actually see Shawn in a new light.

283
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,460
I never thought

284
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,000
that he would actually have some skills.

285
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,520
Quite impressive.

286
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,660
Sis, just because Leo trusts him,

287
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,630
don't blindly trust him too.

288
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,910
Maybe for you,

289
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:28,730
his words are indeed a bit too profound.

290
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,370
But you'll understand later.

291
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,020
Is everyone here yet?

292
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:37,980
Teddy is missing.

293
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,860
Is that guy throwing a tantrum again?

294
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,990
We're not waiting for him. Let's start practicing.

295
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,500
You two must be tired too.

296
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,420
Let me help you.

297
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:52,860
Sit down.

298
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,130
This is a man's job.

299
00:14:56,680 --> 00:14:57,660
What do you mean by that?

300
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,100
Are you criticizing me and Mark?

301
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:02,460
No way, we're learning from you.

302
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:04,380
You big men do the heavy lifting,

303
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,820
carrying drinks for us.

304
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:08,220
We little men can't do that.

305
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:10,620
But handing out drinks is only right.

306
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:12,540
So you admit you're a little man.

307
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,990
You said it yourself!

308
00:15:18,660 --> 00:15:21,660
Mickey! Being young doesn't make you a little man.

309
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:25,500
The "little" in little man has another meaning.

310
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,900
You always complicate simple things.

311
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:31,260
Teddy, why are you so late?

312
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,660
You guys haven't started Training either.

313
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:35,580
Does this look like resting to you?

314
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:37,290
We've already done one round of Training.

315
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,500
What kind of attitude is that?

316
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,860
Well I'm catching up now, aren't I?

317
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:53,940
Stop!

318
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:55,740
I'll teach you a good lesson today.

319
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:58,140
The Tournament is approaching,
why are you throwing a fit?

320
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,540
Swallow up your bad attitude right now!

321
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:04,140
I haven't even had breakfast.
What do you want me to swallow?

322
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,740
Teddy, you haven't even mastered your Signature Move,

323
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:09,660
and you're already getting arrogant!

324
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,100
Watch this.

325
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:21,180
Wow, it's already perfected.

326
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:23,100
Even if your Signature Move is perfected,

327
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,020
you can't let your guard down.

328
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,900
- "One minute on stage, ten years of effort off stage"
- These basics are all for executing your move perfectly.

329
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,300
Mickey, don't interrupt.

330
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,560
My mom always says that.

331
00:16:32,570 --> 00:16:33,280
How do you know that?

332
00:16:33,290 --> 00:16:35,670
It will mess up your performance during the Tournament.

333
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,460
I wasn't being arrogant!

334
00:16:37,660 --> 00:16:38,460
Then what is it?

335
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,780
You were a full hour late,

336
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,740
Do you realize that?

337
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:45,580
Don't tell me your alarm clock broke.

338
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:49,800
When you talk about Leo, you have so much to say.

339
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:51,900
Why are you silent now?

340
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,780
You better reflect on yourself properly.

341
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,660
After you go back,

342
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:58,830
keep polishing your Signature Moves,

343
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:00,540
when Leo returns,

344
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,350
everyone will be tested Individually.

345
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,260
What are you looking at? I've already mastered it.

346
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:09,880
I haven't mastered it yet.

347
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,410
And you, Mini?

348
00:17:12,220 --> 00:17:12,910
I'm not there yet either.

349
00:17:14,540 --> 00:17:16,720
It's nice to have you guys keep me company.

350
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,260
Not yet.

351
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:36,060
Leo, quickly switch back to Orange Holy Light!

352
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,000
David!

353
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,500
You're even earlier than me today,
and I'm the overachiever!

354
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,380
Can I afford to be late?

355
00:18:04,840 --> 00:18:06,300
Otherwise I'll get scolded by Mark again.

356
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,620
I was watching the World Yo-Yo Tournament at home.

357
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:27,420
Wow, am I seeing things?

358
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,340
Today is a Special day.

359
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:31,740
And we're getting new Team Uniforms.

360
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:35,550
Most importantly, Leo is returning to the Team today.

361
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,540
I know that.

362
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,930
But you didn't have to come so early.

363
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:42,300
Attention!

364
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,000
At ease,

365
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:47,580
Everyone's Signature Moves are pretty good.

366
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:50,940
Chuck, Monica, and Mini's moves

367
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,380
aren't very stable yet,

368
00:18:53,120 --> 00:18:55,260
but with more practice and confidence,

369
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:58,140
they should perform fine on the day.

370
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:01,100
The most critical issue right now is Secrecy.

371
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:03,900
No matter the circumstances,

372
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,380
you must not reveal your Signature Moves.

373
00:19:06,060 --> 00:19:07,130
Everyone understand?

374
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,700
Got it!

375
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:15,900
Coach.

376
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:17,720
How's everyone's spirit?

377
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:20,780
Great, we're all in Combat Mode.

378
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:25,640
Coach, you focus on healing too.

379
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:30,300
I'm not worried about anything else, I just wonder

380
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,180
if the Jianghai Team, without a Coach,

381
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:36,290
can still maintain a strong fighting spirit.

382
00:19:40,540 --> 00:19:41,820
Don't worry, Coach.

383
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,220
I already know

384
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,270
how to be a qualified Captain.

385
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:57,180
Sis, what are you doing?

386
00:19:57,640 --> 00:20:00,060
Brushing my teeth. You should hurry up.

387
00:20:00,520 --> 00:20:02,460
Don't always leave things to the last minute.

388
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,820
You don't need to brush your teeth at 5am.

389
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,740
Huh?

390
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,730
Maybe my alarm clock has a problem.

391
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:23,580
I think it's not your alarm clock that has a problem.

392
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:25,500
It's you who has a problem.

